  <data name="DeviceIdWarning" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Changing the ID renames every entity this application publishes. Anything pointing at the old entities stops resolving — no error is reported, the entities are simply no longer there.

The old entities are removed from the broker on confirmation. Their recorded history is not carried over to the new ones.

An empty box restores the name derived from this machine.</value>
